WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:23.249
"I'm so sorry, Bird!" said Kip.

2
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:27.814
"I guess it's okay," said Bird.

3
00:00:27.815 --> 00:00:30.435
"I can fix my nest."

4
00:00:30.436 --> 00:00:32.395
"No," said Kip.

5
00:00:32.396 --> 00:00:36.007
"We can fix your nest.

6
00:00:36.008 --> 00:00:43.044
Let's look for some new sticks."

7
00:00:43.045 --> 00:00:49.327
Bird and Kip looked for new sticks.

8
00:00:49.328 --> 00:01:04.004
They found some in the park.

9
00:01:04.005 --> 00:01:27.267
They found some on the boardwalk.

10
00:01:27.268 --> 00:01:30.107
Then Kip found a fancy stick.

11
00:01:30.108 --> 00:01:33.540
And it was in a car!

12
00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:35.985
"Vroom!" said Kip.

13
00:01:35.986 --> 00:01:39.784
"What are you doing?" asked Bird.

14
00:01:39.785 --> 00:01:43.025
"I'm a race car driver!" said Kip.

15
00:01:43.026 --> 00:01:45.878
"Don't be silly," said Bird.

16
00:01:45.879 --> 00:01:48.426
"You're not a race car driver."

17
00:01:48.427 --> 00:01:51.086
"Come on, Bird," said Kip.

18
00:01:51.087 --> 00:01:53.491
"Let's go for a ride!"

19
00:01:53.492 --> 00:01:58.024
"I don't want to ride in a car," said Bird.

20
00:01:58.025 --> 00:02:00.706
"Cars go too fast."

21
00:02:00.707 --> 00:02:04.507
"But we're just pretending," said Kip.

22
00:02:04.508 --> 00:02:08.022
"Oh, okay," said Bird.

23
00:02:08.023 --> 00:02:10.121
"Why not?"

24
00:02:10.122 --> 00:02:14.877
Bird climbed into the car.

25
00:02:14.878 --> 00:02:22.482
Suddenly it started to move!
